1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,938
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:06,208 --> 00:00:07,958
Here's the latest news.

3
00:00:08,041 --> 00:00:12,458
Ching He's chairman, Huang, has died today while in custody

4
00:00:12,541 --> 00:00:15,458
in connection with the high-profile case.

5
00:00:15,541 --> 00:00:18,250
Initial findings point to a myocardial infarction.

6
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:21,083
An autopsy has ruled out homicide.

7
00:00:21,166 --> 00:00:23,250
Officials have not yet confirmed these reports.

8
00:00:23,333 --> 00:00:26,750
It is unclear how Huang's sudden death will impact the investigation.

9
00:00:26,833 --> 00:00:29,041
We will bring you updates as this story develops.

10
00:00:29,125 --> 00:00:30,291
Next,

11
00:00:30,375 --> 00:00:33,833
Mayor-elect Tristan Hsueh is set to take office.

12
00:00:33,916 --> 00:00:37,750
Ahead of the inauguration, he attended a charity event today.

13
00:00:37,833 --> 00:00:38,958
Tristan Hsueh emphasized

14
00:00:39,041 --> 00:00:42,125
that citizens will come first in future policy.

15
00:00:42,208 --> 00:00:43,875
Goddamn it.

16
00:00:43,958 --> 00:00:45,375
You traitors.

17
00:00:45,458 --> 00:00:46,333
No honor.

18
00:00:46,416 --> 00:00:49,083
They say one thing to your face and another behind your back.

19
00:00:49,166 --> 00:00:51,000
Don't be so angry.

20
00:00:51,583 --> 00:00:54,541
Young people today aren't like we used to be.

21
00:00:54,625 --> 00:00:55,500
Forget about honor.

22
00:00:55,583 --> 00:00:57,583
Be grateful if they don't backstab you.

23
00:00:57,666 --> 00:00:58,875
Fuck.

24
00:00:58,958 --> 00:01:01,208
I saw him as a brother, but he treated me like dirt.

25
00:01:02,125 --> 00:01:03,375
Fuck him!

26
00:01:05,833 --> 00:01:08,000
We want to create a society

27
00:01:08,083 --> 00:01:10,583
defined by kindness and doing what's right.

28
00:01:10,666 --> 00:01:14,000
Transforming a city takes more than just the mayor.

29
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:19,166
It requires our collective wisdom and effort.

30
00:01:20,791 --> 00:01:22,708
THE FIXERS

31
00:01:40,375 --> 00:01:43,750
PRIMORDIAL FILES

32
00:01:43,833 --> 00:01:45,708
Mayor, congratulations on taking office.

33
00:01:45,791 --> 00:01:49,291
Thank you. Everyone's hard work got us to where we are today.

34
00:01:49,375 --> 00:01:50,791
You have our full support.

35
00:01:50,875 --> 00:01:53,375
-Congratulations, Mayor Hsueh. -Hi, Ms. Lu.

36
00:01:53,458 --> 00:01:55,083
-You surpassed the master. -Thanks.

37
00:01:55,166 --> 00:01:57,708
Your father has a successor now.

38
00:01:57,791 --> 00:02:00,291
My dad always tells me to learn from you.

39
00:02:00,375 --> 00:02:01,833
Don't say that.

40
00:02:01,916 --> 00:02:04,875
We're counting on you moving forward, mayor.

41
00:02:04,958 --> 00:02:06,250
Let's catch up another time.

42
00:02:06,333 --> 00:02:07,541
Sure, we'll talk soon.

43
00:02:10,916 --> 00:02:11,916
How are you?

44
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,000
Getting used to it?

45
00:02:13,625 --> 00:02:15,916
These occasions make me wonder

46
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,125
if good acting is nature

47
00:02:18,750 --> 00:02:20,083
or nurture.

48
00:02:21,958 --> 00:02:24,416
I know you don't like these occasions.

49
00:02:29,708 --> 00:02:31,166
How's the key thing going?

50
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:33,583
It's all set.

51
00:02:34,291 --> 00:02:35,125
Just the ceremony.

52
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:37,333
Come with me.

53
00:02:38,291 --> 00:02:40,125
-Minister. -Hi, mayor.

54
00:02:40,875 --> 00:02:42,125
Let me introduce.

55
00:02:42,208 --> 00:02:43,916
This is my brother, Louis Hsueh.

56
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,416
-Hello, Louis. -Hello.

57
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:47,000
I look forward to your support.

58
00:02:47,083 --> 00:02:48,333
Sure, no problem.

59
00:02:51,958 --> 00:02:53,333
DOUBLE HAPPINESS

60
00:03:07,250 --> 00:03:12,000
CHING HE TEMPLE OF TZU YUN CLIFF

61
00:03:12,083 --> 00:03:15,458
MAYOR, TRISTAN HSUEH, MING YOUNG PARTY

62
00:03:17,208 --> 00:03:22,708
Ching He Temple has always been a place where citizens gather in faith and virtue.

63
00:03:23,375 --> 00:03:26,583
Today I came here to pray in the hope that

64
00:03:26,666 --> 00:03:28,958
this new chapter at Ching He Temple

65
00:03:29,041 --> 00:03:30,500
will bring us good luck.

66
00:03:33,041 --> 00:03:34,541
Welcome back.

67
00:03:38,125 --> 00:03:41,250
These two keys are yours to keep now,

68
00:03:41,833 --> 00:03:42,666
chairwoman.

69
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,833
You've worked hard lately, Sir Hong.

70
00:03:46,875 --> 00:03:48,333
Get some rest.

71
00:03:54,666 --> 00:03:56,583
So, on behalf of my cabinet,

72
00:03:56,666 --> 00:03:59,875
I pray that our upcoming initiatives will run smoothly

73
00:03:59,958 --> 00:04:02,000
and bring greater prosperity to everyone.

74
00:04:27,958 --> 00:04:31,541
CELESTIAL

75
00:06:07,083 --> 00:06:14,000
CELESTIAL

76
00:06:19,416 --> 00:06:22,083
You must take back the position

77
00:06:23,416 --> 00:06:24,875
that belongs to you.

78
00:06:26,166 --> 00:06:27,625
Only you

79
00:06:28,416 --> 00:06:32,041
are qualified to be Fixer Celestial.

80
00:06:34,916 --> 00:06:37,375
Make both sides of the law

81
00:06:38,083 --> 00:06:39,750
fear you…

82
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:43,458
and respect you.

83
00:07:15,750 --> 00:07:18,125
After entering Kuang Ming Chamber,

84
00:07:18,625 --> 00:07:21,833
find the compass of Primordial Files.

85
00:07:22,416 --> 00:07:23,750
Align the dials…

86
00:07:23,833 --> 00:07:24,833
PRIMORDIUM

87
00:07:24,916 --> 00:07:26,791
…in this specific order.

88
00:07:27,875 --> 00:07:29,750
East, Frost's Descent.

89
00:07:29,833 --> 00:07:30,708
FROST'S DESCENT

90
00:07:30,791 --> 00:07:32,125
West, year 1909.

91
00:07:33,083 --> 00:07:33,916
YEAR 1909

92
00:07:35,125 --> 00:07:36,875
South, morning hours five to seven.

93
00:07:36,958 --> 00:07:37,958
MORNING HOURS 5 TO 7

94
00:07:38,041 --> 00:07:39,416
True North.

95
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:41,333
TRUE

96
00:07:41,416 --> 00:07:43,666
With this passcode,

97
00:07:44,375 --> 00:07:47,833
you can enter the secret tunnel to the Primordial Files.

98
00:07:48,958 --> 00:07:53,958
This date marks the day Liao Tien-ting faked his death

99
00:07:54,041 --> 00:07:58,250
and reemerged as the first Fixer Primordium.

100
00:07:59,250 --> 00:08:02,166
Only Fixer Celestial and Fixer Primordium

101
00:08:02,250 --> 00:08:04,833
have access to the secret tunnel.

102
00:08:05,333 --> 00:08:11,791
Forced entry would trigger the destruction of the Primordial Files.

103
00:08:11,875 --> 00:08:14,583
If the Primordial Files fall into the wrong hands…

104
00:08:14,666 --> 00:08:16,250
If she reclaims Ching He,

105
00:08:16,333 --> 00:08:18,166
she will have the Hsuehs by the throat.

106
00:08:18,250 --> 00:08:20,875
…the balance of the world will be broken.

107
00:08:20,958 --> 00:08:23,333
So we must get to the Primordial Files before her.

108
00:08:24,250 --> 00:08:26,583
That way, we can control both sides of the law.

109
00:08:27,333 --> 00:08:29,708
Neither Ching He nor Yeh Yueh Tong…

110
00:08:29,791 --> 00:08:32,916
-If I take over, what about Madam Fan? -…can threaten the Hsuehs.

111
00:08:43,083 --> 00:08:45,791
If that happens, I fear no one will be able to save it.

112
00:08:45,875 --> 00:08:48,833
Leave that to the next head of Ching He.

113
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:52,250
Do you really think

114
00:08:52,333 --> 00:08:57,625
the Hsuehs will spare those who know about their secret

115
00:08:58,125 --> 00:09:00,083
if they find out about the video?

116
00:09:01,166 --> 00:09:03,458
SEVERAL DAYS AGO

117
00:09:03,541 --> 00:09:06,666
If the Primordial Files fall into the hands of those in the light,

118
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:09,125
their power will grow indefinitely.

119
00:09:10,375 --> 00:09:12,666
If the Files fall to those in the dark,

120
00:09:13,541 --> 00:09:15,250
crime will become more rampant.

121
00:09:16,250 --> 00:09:18,041
Having them keep each other in check

122
00:09:18,125 --> 00:09:20,333
is the only way to truly protect

123
00:09:20,416 --> 00:09:21,416
the Hsueh family,

124
00:09:21,916 --> 00:09:23,208
Ching He,

125
00:09:23,708 --> 00:09:25,375
and your partner.

126
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,500
You're not wrong.

127
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,375
But you never had the Primordial Files, did you?

128
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,416
My brother said

129
00:09:36,500 --> 00:09:40,000
only Madam Fan knows how to open the secret tunnel to the Primordial Files.

130
00:09:41,625 --> 00:09:43,208
No wonder you want to trap her.

131
00:09:43,791 --> 00:09:45,083
What are you going to do?

132
00:09:48,583 --> 00:09:51,250
Damn it, it'll be harder next time.

133
00:09:51,333 --> 00:09:52,250
Fuck!

134
00:10:03,708 --> 00:10:04,750
Sir Hong,

135
00:10:04,833 --> 00:10:06,000
are you a traitor too?

136
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:09,583
I came to thank you on behalf of the chairman.

137
00:10:18,583 --> 00:10:21,458
Fixer Lunar will kill me for sure.

138
00:10:23,416 --> 00:10:25,458
I need your help.

139
00:10:34,958 --> 00:10:37,875
So you and the chairman set a trap

140
00:10:38,500 --> 00:10:41,208
to get the Primordial Files from Madam Fan?

141
00:10:41,291 --> 00:10:43,416
Fixer Gold stopped you from killing Lunar

142
00:10:43,916 --> 00:10:45,583
for a reason.

143
00:10:46,875 --> 00:10:49,291
So he was working with you two?

144
00:10:50,291 --> 00:10:53,083
It might be better to let him explain.

145
00:10:58,500 --> 00:10:59,666
Fucking bastard.

146
00:11:00,250 --> 00:11:01,583
You kept us in the dark.

147
00:11:03,791 --> 00:11:07,416
Otherwise, Madam Fan wouldn't have believed it.

148
00:11:08,708 --> 00:11:11,166
I have a plan to get everyone out safely.

149
00:11:11,666 --> 00:11:12,916
I need you on this.

150
00:11:21,666 --> 00:11:22,833
Welcome back.

151
00:11:24,458 --> 00:11:27,875
These two keys are yours to keep now,

152
00:11:29,041 --> 00:11:30,083
chairwoman.

153
00:11:30,875 --> 00:11:32,750
You've worked hard lately, Sir Hong.

154
00:11:34,083 --> 00:11:35,458
Get some rest.

155
00:12:11,625 --> 00:12:12,833
Hands up.

156
00:12:15,083 --> 00:12:16,125
Get out of the car.

157
00:12:26,125 --> 00:12:27,833
Madam Fan has returned to Ching He.

158
00:12:28,333 --> 00:12:30,166
I advise you not to do this.

159
00:12:34,625 --> 00:12:36,333
I'll ask one last time.

160
00:12:37,125 --> 00:12:39,041
Where are the case files?

161
00:12:41,208 --> 00:12:42,833
What do you want them for?

162
00:12:48,833 --> 00:12:53,500
She is not only ruthless, but also swift.

163
00:12:54,916 --> 00:12:56,541
I guessed right.

164
00:12:57,750 --> 00:12:59,250
After all this time,

165
00:12:59,875 --> 00:13:01,083
you still don't know her?

166
00:13:02,458 --> 00:13:05,916
Even I know what kind of person she is.

167
00:13:07,166 --> 00:13:10,250
Of those who have done dirty work for her,

168
00:13:11,208 --> 00:13:14,125
how many are still alive?

169
00:13:16,083 --> 00:13:17,583
Before you kill me,

170
00:13:18,083 --> 00:13:19,625
think carefully.

171
00:13:20,166 --> 00:13:22,041
Are you working for the right person?

172
00:15:14,833 --> 00:15:16,291
PRIMORDIUM

173
00:15:50,250 --> 00:15:51,708
Well, look at that.

174
00:15:52,208 --> 00:15:53,833
Being mayor isn't enough.

175
00:15:54,583 --> 00:15:56,458
You should have known.

176
00:15:57,625 --> 00:15:58,458
I did.

177
00:15:59,625 --> 00:16:01,041
Just not that you'd act so fast

178
00:16:01,875 --> 00:16:03,416
and do it yourself.

179
00:16:03,916 --> 00:16:05,250
I've learned my lesson.

180
00:16:06,458 --> 00:16:08,583
If you want something done right,

181
00:16:09,250 --> 00:16:11,250
do it yourself.

182
00:16:12,416 --> 00:16:14,291
You think you can handle Ching He

183
00:16:14,375 --> 00:16:16,250
without me?

184
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:18,875
The other six chairpersons

185
00:16:19,916 --> 00:16:21,625
aren't easy to deal with.

186
00:16:21,708 --> 00:16:24,250
Who says I want to take over Ching He?

187
00:16:25,625 --> 00:16:28,625
You were right about having one in the dark and one in the light.

188
00:16:33,416 --> 00:16:34,666
Louis Hsueh?

189
00:16:39,250 --> 00:16:42,625
If you kill Ching He's chairperson in the Kuang Ming Chamber,

190
00:16:43,416 --> 00:16:45,041
do you know what will happen?

191
00:16:45,125 --> 00:16:45,958
I don't.

192
00:16:47,416 --> 00:16:49,333
But the living will tell me.

193
00:16:57,333 --> 00:16:58,666
Before you kill me…

194
00:17:00,791 --> 00:17:02,541
let me go in and take a look.

195
00:17:04,875 --> 00:17:07,166
Sorry, I can't do that.

196
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:26,250
I wouldn't have done this

197
00:17:28,083 --> 00:17:29,416
if I had any other option.

198
00:18:14,583 --> 00:18:15,708
Hello, mayor.

199
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:21,000
Mayor,

200
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:22,750
long time no see.

201
00:18:23,708 --> 00:18:26,708
I just made tea. Come have a cup.

202
00:18:29,166 --> 00:18:30,000
What is it?

203
00:18:30,083 --> 00:18:34,333
Are you surprised the Primordial Tunnel led you back to Tai Sui Hall

204
00:18:34,416 --> 00:18:35,750
or that I am here?

205
00:18:53,583 --> 00:18:55,166
Sir Hong told me to give you this.

206
00:18:55,750 --> 00:18:57,000
And this stamp.

207
00:18:58,125 --> 00:19:01,500
After you take it, your heart will stop temporarily.

208
00:19:19,791 --> 00:19:20,666
Please.

209
00:19:49,750 --> 00:19:52,791
Since when did San He become Thackery's lackey?

210
00:19:53,291 --> 00:19:55,125
You're invited to tea,

211
00:19:55,208 --> 00:19:57,166
so fucking drink the tea.

212
00:19:57,666 --> 00:19:59,916
We pay back in kind.

213
00:20:05,583 --> 00:20:06,583
Chairman,

214
00:20:07,833 --> 00:20:09,041
may I smoke?

215
00:20:09,875 --> 00:20:11,000
Of course.

216
00:20:11,083 --> 00:20:12,708
But you're the first.

217
00:20:14,208 --> 00:20:15,875
So you've summoned these guys.

218
00:20:16,375 --> 00:20:18,375
I'm not leaving today, am I?

219
00:20:19,791 --> 00:20:20,625
Mayor,

220
00:20:21,125 --> 00:20:24,416
whether you can leave or not is up to you.

221
00:20:29,708 --> 00:20:30,708
Pin,

222
00:20:30,791 --> 00:20:34,000
please take them to the temple entrance.

223
00:20:34,083 --> 00:20:37,208
I don't want anyone to come in.

224
00:20:53,750 --> 00:20:56,166
Mayor, here's the thing.

225
00:20:56,791 --> 00:20:58,875
Don't be fooled by the tranquility here.

226
00:20:59,458 --> 00:21:02,000
A storm is raging outside.

227
00:21:02,500 --> 00:21:04,166
Everyone is busy.

228
00:25:01,041 --> 00:25:02,375
You can't even hold a gun.

229
00:25:02,875 --> 00:25:04,750
And you want to shoot?

230
00:25:09,708 --> 00:25:11,708
Do you know what my symptoms are?

231
00:25:14,625 --> 00:25:16,291
If I try to hold something still,

232
00:25:16,791 --> 00:25:18,541
my hand shakes.

233
00:25:55,541 --> 00:25:57,541
But if I keep moving,

234
00:25:58,125 --> 00:25:59,833
it doesn't shake.

235
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:01,833
Fatass.

236
00:26:01,916 --> 00:26:03,333
Fuck you!

237
00:26:10,583 --> 00:26:13,500
Look on my works, ye Mighty, and despair.

238
00:26:14,000 --> 00:26:16,916
This one shot is the peak of my career.

239
00:26:18,750 --> 00:26:19,916
Chi…

240
00:26:21,833 --> 00:26:23,375
I fucking did it.

241
00:26:40,875 --> 00:26:42,291
You set me up.

242
00:26:43,333 --> 00:26:45,125
So the Primordial Entrance was fake?

243
00:26:47,416 --> 00:26:50,000
We originally wanted Madam Fan

244
00:26:50,083 --> 00:26:52,833
to walk through the tunnel.

245
00:26:52,916 --> 00:26:56,958
CELESTIAL

246
00:27:12,666 --> 00:27:14,291
PRIMORDIUM

247
00:27:33,166 --> 00:27:35,583
CELESTIAL

248
00:27:43,458 --> 00:27:45,125
CELESTIAL

249
00:28:48,458 --> 00:28:49,958
So you've been working together?

250
00:28:53,458 --> 00:28:55,125
I dealt with Madam Fan

251
00:28:55,875 --> 00:28:57,916
so you could take control of Ching He.

252
00:28:59,291 --> 00:29:02,333
But you teamed up with Thackery to betray me.

253
00:29:16,208 --> 00:29:18,041
This is from Hsu Ming-yi's dashcam.

254
00:29:22,958 --> 00:29:24,250
You lied to me.

255
00:29:24,333 --> 00:29:26,791
Dad didn't kill Hsu Ming-yi.

256
00:29:39,583 --> 00:29:41,250
This should be enough, right?

257
00:29:41,750 --> 00:29:42,750
Sir,

258
00:29:43,750 --> 00:29:45,291
what do you take me for?

259
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,708
I'm not after money.

260
00:29:50,833 --> 00:29:52,125
So what do you want?

261
00:29:56,583 --> 00:29:58,625
I've been an aide all these years

262
00:29:59,125 --> 00:30:01,708
so I could eventually become a legislator.

263
00:30:03,291 --> 00:30:04,625
But I'm a nobody.

264
00:30:05,125 --> 00:30:06,583
I can't get elected.

265
00:30:08,375 --> 00:30:09,333
But if…

266
00:30:10,583 --> 00:30:13,458
If the Hsueh family is willing to back me,

267
00:30:13,958 --> 00:30:15,458
I'll have a chance.

268
00:30:16,625 --> 00:30:17,500
Is that a threat?

269
00:30:19,916 --> 00:30:24,208
If the juicy scoop on the Hsuehs's role in the Hsin Nan redevelopment project

270
00:30:25,291 --> 00:30:26,708
got leaked,

271
00:30:27,666 --> 00:30:28,750
do you think

272
00:30:29,250 --> 00:30:31,125
you could still stand here

273
00:30:31,625 --> 00:30:32,666
and negotiate with me?

274
00:30:40,583 --> 00:30:43,458
Do you know how hard I worked

275
00:30:44,583 --> 00:30:46,208
to get to where I am today?

276
00:30:46,875 --> 00:30:48,291
That's why I say

277
00:30:48,791 --> 00:30:51,833
work with me, so we both win.

278
00:30:59,333 --> 00:31:00,791
Think about it.

279
00:31:01,791 --> 00:31:02,916
Hello, sweetie.

280
00:31:04,666 --> 00:31:07,625
It's fine. I'm enjoying my chat with the councilor.

281
00:31:11,375 --> 00:31:13,083
Okay, I'll be back soon.

282
00:31:13,833 --> 00:31:14,958
Don't worry.

283
00:31:17,791 --> 00:31:18,791
I know.

284
00:31:18,875 --> 00:31:20,166
Fuck!

285
00:31:22,208 --> 00:31:23,750
Negotiating with me?

286
00:31:23,833 --> 00:31:26,958
Negotiating with me?

287
00:31:30,416 --> 00:31:32,583
Hello? Honey?

288
00:31:33,083 --> 00:31:35,375
What's wrong? What was that sound?

289
00:31:35,458 --> 00:31:36,708
What happened--

290
00:31:46,250 --> 00:31:48,125
You were worried this would get out,

291
00:31:48,208 --> 00:31:50,041
so you went to Yeh Yueh Tong

292
00:31:50,541 --> 00:31:52,958
to erase every trace of you

293
00:31:53,458 --> 00:31:56,458
and get rid of everyone who knows about this.

294
00:31:57,166 --> 00:32:00,833
You were never trying to cover up Dad's scandal.

295
00:32:01,625 --> 00:32:04,041
You were trying to save your political career.

296
00:32:06,125 --> 00:32:08,250
Do you think I got this far

297
00:32:08,333 --> 00:32:10,625
by doing nothing?

298
00:32:11,291 --> 00:32:12,833
In everyone's eyes,

299
00:32:13,333 --> 00:32:15,500
I'm just Jerome Hsueh's puppet.

300
00:32:16,000 --> 00:32:18,458
No one can see my accomplishments.

301
00:32:21,083 --> 00:32:24,875
Hsu Ming-yi thought he had some dirt on me

302
00:32:24,958 --> 00:32:26,916
and could use me as a stepping stone.

303
00:32:30,916 --> 00:32:32,208
Unlike you,

304
00:32:32,708 --> 00:32:34,791
I can't afford any mistakes.

305
00:32:35,833 --> 00:32:37,166
Dad has no idea, right?

306
00:32:39,750 --> 00:32:42,750
You know, sometimes I really envy you.

307
00:32:43,250 --> 00:32:44,833
You can do whatever you want.

308
00:32:45,875 --> 00:32:46,958
I just never expected

309
00:32:47,916 --> 00:32:49,666
that the one to stab me in the back

310
00:32:49,750 --> 00:32:51,416
would be my own brother.

311
00:32:54,458 --> 00:32:57,791
This is the only way to strike a three-way balance

312
00:32:57,875 --> 00:32:59,708
between Ching He and the Hsuehs.

313
00:32:59,791 --> 00:33:02,666
You teamed up with Ching He, and now you talk about balance?

314
00:33:06,416 --> 00:33:08,250
I found this in the Primordial Files.

315
00:33:08,333 --> 00:33:10,041
CASE FILE, DOUBLE SHADOW TOP SECRET, THACKERY HUANG

316
00:33:13,541 --> 00:33:16,041
I was going to use secrets from the Primordial Files

317
00:33:16,125 --> 00:33:18,250
as leverage to balance the scales.

318
00:33:18,916 --> 00:33:21,083
CASE FILE, JIANGNAN, PRIMORDIUM, 1984 CELESTIAL ACCESS ONLY

319
00:33:21,166 --> 00:33:23,333
But I found something about you, Fixer Solar.

320
00:33:23,916 --> 00:33:26,458
CASE FILE, DOUBLE SHADOW TOP SECRET, THACKERY HUANG

321
00:33:26,541 --> 00:33:28,333
Back then, you asked Fixer Primordium

322
00:33:28,416 --> 00:33:32,583
to conveniently frame Madam Fan's dad for the death of a fixer.

323
00:33:34,500 --> 00:33:35,958
However, we discovered

324
00:33:36,458 --> 00:33:39,416
that the murder of Ching He's fixer

325
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:41,333
is connected to you.

326
00:33:42,291 --> 00:33:44,250
So we must postpone

327
00:33:44,875 --> 00:33:48,666
handing over the position of Fixer Celestial to your daughter.

328
00:33:52,916 --> 00:33:55,291
And this is just one of your dirty deeds.

329
00:33:59,375 --> 00:34:01,291
No wonder you wanted the Primordial Files.

330
00:34:01,791 --> 00:34:03,375
So you could destroy them, right?

331
00:34:05,041 --> 00:34:07,500
If this information got leaked,

332
00:34:07,583 --> 00:34:10,458
what would top officials and other branches think?

333
00:34:15,625 --> 00:34:17,666
I never thought you would threaten me.

334
00:34:19,166 --> 00:34:21,000
The third party you mentioned

335
00:34:21,083 --> 00:34:22,541
is you, isn't it?

336
00:34:23,041 --> 00:34:24,208
It's not a threat.

337
00:34:24,291 --> 00:34:25,833
It's balance.

338
00:34:26,875 --> 00:34:29,750
If any one party wants to disrupt this balance,

339
00:34:30,250 --> 00:34:32,541
they will have to pay the price.

340
00:34:37,208 --> 00:34:39,833
Since we were kids, I've always known you were smart.

341
00:34:39,916 --> 00:34:42,708
That's why I'd rather you fool around than get serious.

342
00:34:43,583 --> 00:34:47,500
Because I knew that once you got serious, you would become my biggest problem.

343
00:34:51,291 --> 00:34:56,875
So Ching He will be counting on the Hsueh family from now on.

344
00:34:58,750 --> 00:35:00,208
Do I have a choice?

345
00:35:01,125 --> 00:35:02,291
One set the trap,

346
00:35:02,375 --> 00:35:03,625
and the other sprung it.

347
00:35:04,833 --> 00:35:07,166
I was just going with the flow.

348
00:35:09,291 --> 00:35:13,041
This pawn put me in check too.

349
00:35:15,916 --> 00:35:18,500
You truly are better than me at everything.

350
00:35:19,416 --> 00:35:20,708
I've said it before.

351
00:35:21,208 --> 00:35:22,875
I'll help the family one day,

352
00:35:23,708 --> 00:35:25,625
but in my own way.

353
00:36:12,791 --> 00:36:13,708
Howie,

354
00:36:14,458 --> 00:36:16,583
tell your mom that it's all good now.

355
00:36:17,416 --> 00:36:21,000
You didn't see how cool your dad was just now.

356
00:36:23,625 --> 00:36:26,333
I'll come get you guys later. We're going home.

357
00:36:30,916 --> 00:36:32,583
You escaped again?

358
00:36:34,833 --> 00:36:35,666
What?

359
00:36:36,291 --> 00:36:37,750
Did you miss me?

360
00:36:38,541 --> 00:36:40,333
I couldn't be happier to be rid of you.

361
00:36:40,833 --> 00:36:41,666
Get in.

362
00:36:42,625 --> 00:36:43,708
I bought you bread.

363
00:36:48,458 --> 00:36:50,250
Are you trying to trick me again?

364
00:37:03,125 --> 00:37:05,333
It takes a lot to knock me down.

365
00:37:05,833 --> 00:37:07,333
If I flop,

366
00:37:07,416 --> 00:37:09,416
I'll crawl back without shame.

367
00:37:09,916 --> 00:37:13,500
Nobody gets out without a few scars.

368
00:37:14,875 --> 00:37:18,625
We'll get back in the game if this gig falls apart.

369
00:37:19,958 --> 00:37:21,750
Scallion is always the best.

370
00:37:26,875 --> 00:37:28,708
ARCADE

371
00:37:36,625 --> 00:37:38,000
What's next for you?

372
00:37:39,125 --> 00:37:41,125
I want to go abroad to study

373
00:37:42,083 --> 00:37:43,458
and start afresh.

374
00:37:47,125 --> 00:37:50,125
What will you do about Madam Fan's death?

375
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:55,333
Others will only think that Madam Fan is missing.

376
00:37:58,666 --> 00:37:59,500
What about you?

377
00:38:00,208 --> 00:38:01,875
Are you gonna stay with Ching He?

378
00:38:02,375 --> 00:38:04,625
I'm the only one neither side will touch.

379
00:38:04,708 --> 00:38:07,958
If I don't stay, the balance of terror won't last.

380
00:38:08,041 --> 00:38:10,291
Aren't you stuck, then?

381
00:38:12,041 --> 00:38:13,458
Should I sell noodles with you?

382
00:38:14,041 --> 00:38:15,000
You could.

383
00:38:17,583 --> 00:38:20,916
Turns out you're the one who can't just walk away.

384
00:38:28,625 --> 00:38:29,833
I should go.

385
00:38:44,833 --> 00:38:45,958
See you again.

386
00:38:54,666 --> 00:38:57,333
I'm leaving Ben's stall to you.

387
00:38:57,833 --> 00:38:59,375
Take good care of it for me.

388
00:39:18,750 --> 00:39:21,125
Hey. Not gonna go after her?

389
00:39:21,916 --> 00:39:23,708
What for? Are we in a romantic drama?

390
00:39:24,458 --> 00:39:26,125
Shouldn't you go see a doctor?

391
00:39:26,208 --> 00:39:27,291
I'm waiting for a ride.

392
00:39:29,083 --> 00:39:30,166
Let's go.

393
00:39:32,833 --> 00:39:34,958
You're so fussy, jeez.

394
00:39:41,708 --> 00:39:45,750
To maintain that balance, you need the dark, the light, and the in-between.

395
00:39:46,250 --> 00:39:49,541
Is this the excuse you've come up with for your brother?

396
00:39:50,708 --> 00:39:53,583
Delete all the closed case files in Yeh Yueh Tong.

397
00:39:54,541 --> 00:39:56,875
Ching He has leverage over Tristan Hsueh.

398
00:39:57,666 --> 00:39:59,166
I have leverage over Ching He.

399
00:39:59,666 --> 00:40:02,041
This is the only way to achieve true balance.

400
00:40:02,916 --> 00:40:04,291
Are you telling me this

401
00:40:05,333 --> 00:40:07,166
as Ching He's Fixer Gold

402
00:40:08,458 --> 00:40:10,375
or as the Hsueh family's younger son?

403
00:40:13,958 --> 00:40:15,250
Louis Hsueh.

404
00:40:52,666 --> 00:40:54,416
I don't know if you can still hear me.

405
00:40:55,708 --> 00:40:58,625
If you knew, you would definitely say that I betrayed Tristan.

406
00:41:01,291 --> 00:41:05,083
All my life, I'd wanted to prove that I was no worse than him.

407
00:41:07,000 --> 00:41:09,416
But after so much, I realized

408
00:41:10,625 --> 00:41:13,583
it wasn't worth my time at all.

409
00:41:25,583 --> 00:41:27,458
If you see Mom after you leave us,

410
00:41:28,458 --> 00:41:29,958
please be nicer to her.

411
00:41:41,708 --> 00:41:46,166
Fixer Lucky, your departure will be a great loss to Ching He.

412
00:41:46,916 --> 00:41:50,000
And you've just gotten your touch back.

413
00:41:50,500 --> 00:41:51,583
Why do you want to…

414
00:41:51,666 --> 00:41:52,666
It's time to retire.

415
00:41:52,750 --> 00:41:55,625
I don't know when my disease will worsen.

416
00:41:55,708 --> 00:41:57,541
And my son will be in high school soon.

417
00:41:57,625 --> 00:41:59,916
Kids stop calling once they're in college.

418
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:02,166
I only have three more precious years with him.

419
00:42:02,916 --> 00:42:03,750
That's true.

420
00:42:04,250 --> 00:42:07,041
But honestly, if you hadn't helped,

421
00:42:07,125 --> 00:42:10,250
Ching He wouldn't have gotten back on its feet.

422
00:42:11,333 --> 00:42:12,333
You hear that?

423
00:42:16,791 --> 00:42:17,666
Hey, Sir Hong.

424
00:42:18,583 --> 00:42:20,333
Is your arm all right?

425
00:42:20,833 --> 00:42:22,875
It's fine. I will survive.

426
00:42:23,375 --> 00:42:27,625
This sum will be enough for a comfortable life after you retire.

427
00:42:27,708 --> 00:42:28,750
But remember--

428
00:42:28,833 --> 00:42:31,041
Don't disclose anything about Ching He.

429
00:42:31,625 --> 00:42:32,500
Of course.

430
00:42:33,250 --> 00:42:34,333
Don't worry.

431
00:42:34,416 --> 00:42:38,083
I'll come here to pray and have tea whenever I'm free, so don't miss me.

432
00:42:38,166 --> 00:42:39,666
Get out of here already.

433
00:42:39,750 --> 00:42:41,083
-I'll walk you out. -Okay.

434
00:42:41,583 --> 00:42:42,416
Thank you.

435
00:42:42,916 --> 00:42:44,000
Thank you, chairman.

436
00:42:44,958 --> 00:42:46,125
Thank you, Sir Hong.

437
00:42:46,208 --> 00:42:47,583
-Take care. -Take care.

438
00:42:47,666 --> 00:42:48,500
Take care.

439
00:42:52,416 --> 00:42:53,916
If you're bored someday,

440
00:42:54,000 --> 00:42:56,250
come pick up a gig for extra cash.

441
00:42:56,333 --> 00:42:58,541
When you're bored, come to my place.

442
00:42:58,625 --> 00:43:00,250
I'll cook something nice for you.

443
00:43:01,208 --> 00:43:02,875
Maybe I'll come tomorrow.

444
00:43:04,666 --> 00:43:05,666
Oh, right.

445
00:43:06,833 --> 00:43:09,125
Roses are red, violets are blue. What comes next?

446
00:43:12,166 --> 00:43:13,291
Damn.

447
00:43:13,875 --> 00:43:15,375
Still just as uncultured.

448
00:43:21,291 --> 00:43:23,208
I'll take you down a peg or two.

449
00:43:43,083 --> 00:43:44,333
AUTHENTIC TIEN-BU-LA

450
00:43:44,416 --> 00:43:46,208
FELIX'S STIR-FRIED SWAMP EEL

451
00:43:52,958 --> 00:43:54,958
-Hey, Howie. -Hey.

452
00:43:55,541 --> 00:43:56,375
Come.

453
00:43:56,875 --> 00:43:59,500
The noodles and tien-bu-la are for the back table.

454
00:43:59,583 --> 00:44:00,541
Okay.

455
00:44:04,083 --> 00:44:06,416
-How's that? -Holy cow.

456
00:44:06,500 --> 00:44:08,000
Do your noodles taste that good?

457
00:44:08,083 --> 00:44:09,208
You haven't gone under.

458
00:44:09,291 --> 00:44:11,333
Hey, business is booming.

459
00:44:11,416 --> 00:44:12,958
There's a line every day.

460
00:44:13,041 --> 00:44:15,500
We have 4.9 stars on Google. You saw that?

461
00:44:15,583 --> 00:44:17,791
Don't you start. You argue with customers online.

462
00:44:17,875 --> 00:44:19,333
Don't think I didn't see that.

463
00:44:19,416 --> 00:44:22,833
You can't blame me. They're difficult. They love my food but still complain.

464
00:44:22,916 --> 00:44:23,750
All right.

465
00:44:24,250 --> 00:44:26,750
I'll bring my boyfriend there next time.

466
00:44:26,833 --> 00:44:30,000
Let me tell you, he's a great cook. He would put you to shame.

467
00:44:30,083 --> 00:44:31,166
Hey, no.

468
00:44:31,250 --> 00:44:34,041
When Howie's exams are done, we will travel to the US.

469
00:44:34,125 --> 00:44:36,000
I'll cook for your foreign boyfriend.

470
00:44:36,083 --> 00:44:38,458
Dummy, where will you find swamp eels here?

471
00:44:38,958 --> 00:44:41,041
All right, see you. Bye.

472
00:44:43,708 --> 00:44:45,583
Loach, check, please.

473
00:44:45,666 --> 00:44:47,125
-I've got it. -Hey, no.

474
00:44:47,208 --> 00:44:48,833
Milky shouldn't pay. On the house.

475
00:44:48,916 --> 00:44:49,750
Hey.

476
00:44:49,833 --> 00:44:51,625
-I'd feel bad about this. -It's fine.

477
00:44:51,708 --> 00:44:53,916
Of course you would. You get it free every time.

478
00:44:54,541 --> 00:44:56,333
Yeah, I really want to pay.

479
00:44:56,416 --> 00:44:57,500
No need.

480
00:44:57,583 --> 00:44:58,416
Gosh.

481
00:44:58,500 --> 00:44:59,333
Hey, come again.

482
00:44:59,416 --> 00:45:00,458
Bye.

483
00:45:56,375 --> 00:45:58,375
Long time no see, Fixer Primordium.

484
00:45:59,500 --> 00:46:05,208
PRIMORDIUM

485
00:46:05,291 --> 00:46:06,458
Fixer Primordium

486
00:46:06,958 --> 00:46:11,333
does not report to anyone, not even Fixer Celestial.

487
00:46:12,625 --> 00:46:17,291
When Fixer Primordium shows up,

488
00:46:18,250 --> 00:46:19,750
it means

489
00:46:20,541 --> 00:46:26,041
something is about to go down in history.

490
00:49:54,250 --> 00:49:57,041
Subtitle translation by: Hannah Liu
